1
00:00:00,262 --> 00:00:03,642
- Is it too much?
- Not if you're a rugby team.

2
00:00:05,308 --> 00:00:08,268
By the way, you didn't join us
because you stuffed yourself...

3
00:00:08,436 --> 00:00:10,646
...with a chicken-carbonara sub
at Quizno's.

4
00:00:11,106 --> 00:00:12,236
(Sheldon:)Why would I join you?

5
00:00:13,233 --> 00:00:14,733
(Leonard:)No reason.

6
00:00:17,112 --> 00:00:19,572
Oh, you know what?
Maybe this isn't such a good idea.

7
00:00:19,739 --> 00:00:22,119
Oh, no, well, now,
there's always the possibility...

8
00:00:22,284 --> 00:00:24,494
...that alcohol and poor judgment
on her part...

9
00:00:24,661 --> 00:00:27,041
(Sheldon:)...might lead to a nice romantic evening.

10
00:00:28,582 --> 00:00:31,832
You're right. Alcohol, poor judgment.
It could go well.

11
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:35,500
(Sheldon:)Of course, there's the other possibility
that this day kicks off...

12
00:00:35,672 --> 00:00:38,762
...an unpleasant six months of you
passing awkwardly in the hall...

13
00:00:38,925 --> 00:00:41,805
(Sheldon:)...until one of you breaks down
and moves to another zip code.

14
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:45,260
(Leonard:)You could have stopped at,
"It could go well."

15
00:00:45,849 --> 00:00:47,889
If I could have, I would have.

16
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:50,900
(Leonard:)I mean, I'm a perfectly nice guy.
There's no reason...

17
00:00:51,062 --> 00:00:53,852
(Leonard:)...we couldn't go to the restaurant
and have a lovely dinner.

18
00:00:54,024 --> 00:00:58,654
(Leonard:)Maybe take a walk afterwards,
talk about things we have in common.

